torname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $3,-4,0,$ and $2.$ The maximum output is $3$ (at $t=-2$), and the minimum output is $-4$ (at $t=-1$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-2 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-4 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "3d5d27c0-3347-5be2-804c-f52fe79f2580" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186550078}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186550052 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549943 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549570}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549570} :answer-field/id #uuid "14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549802} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "444d695f-eab4-54fb-aadd-bba536c6e35e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549457}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549457} :answer-field/id #uuid "454cc990-2c69-5f82-8f07-4ebe88482891" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549831} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29f448ec-e2f7-5423-9c43-b27c85d08ed7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549409}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549409} :answer-field/id #uuid "9336c99c-17c3-5144-b0dc-5fdffe1c6c29" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549869} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bad574c3-61ab-5018-b7c2-e81c899ee288" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921860454